Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 14 | Text: 施永欣這件事告訴了我們一個什麼道理呢
Segment #2   [00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,900] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你有100塊錢
Segment #3   [00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,140] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 你給佛祖說30佛祖會告訴你
Segment #4   [00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,280] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 十祖平安
Segment #5   [00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:10,860] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 16 | Text: 你有100塊錢你給佛祖說50佛祖會照著你
Segment #6   [00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:14,780] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 16 | Text: 你有100塊錢你如果說敢去給佛祖說90那好了
Segment #7   [00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,820] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 12 | Text: 佛祖保佑你一輩子一時無憂
Segment #8   [00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:17,980] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 是不是這個邏輯
Segment #9   [00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,960] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 9  | Text: 為什麼施永欣大師傅有問題
Segment #10  [00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,880] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 因為輸的錢太多了
Segment #11  [00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,880] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 他媽他散出去的錢太少了
Segment #12  [00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:26,680] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 今天給你們分享一個詞上叫流瘀
Segment #13  [00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,220] | Elapsed:  14.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 什麼叫流瘀
Segment #14  [00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,560] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 12 | Text: 就是流有瘀不禁之巧以環造化
Segment #15  [00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,920] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 流有瘀不禁縫路以環朝廷
Segment #16  [00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:35,220] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 流有瘀不禁之才以環鄉鄰
Segment #17  [00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,240] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 5  | Text: 最後還有一句話
Segment #18  [00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:40,680] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 16 | Text: 就是流有瘀不禁之才不禁之福以環子孫
Segment #19  [00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:43,640] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 14 | Text: 一個人如果說是名利雙說那就意味著什麼
Segment #20  [00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,960] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 意味著他該走了
Segment #21  [00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:47,280] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 14 | Text: 因為他把一輩子該想的福都已經想完了
Segment #22  [00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,600] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 這不是迷信仰更不是無言聳聽
Segment #23  [00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,760] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 13 | Text: 你看當年南游省萬三北游康百萬
Segment #24  [00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,640] | Elapsed:  31.24s | Words: 15 | Text: 省萬三坐大以後在朱元璋面前炫富
Segment #25  [00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,860] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 14 | Text: 說還要說著幫朱元璋去整備軍隊
Segment #26  [00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,860] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 那當時朱元璋心想
Segment #27  [00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,460] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 7  | Text: 嗯你一個民營企業
Segment #28  [00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:04,900] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 11 | Text: 你還有實力我整備一支軍隊
Segment #29  [00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,300] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 那我還能睡踏實了
Segment #30  [00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,940] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 9  | Text: 再說了也沒有你這麼狂的
Segment #31  [00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:09,720] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 10 | Text: 然後最後就把省萬三給滅了
Segment #32  [00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:09,960] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #33  [00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:12,020] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 然後最後你看這個康家
Segment #34  [00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:15,280] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 13 | Text: 他為什麼能從朱元璋一直到中華民族
Segment #35  [00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:16,780] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 這得多多少年
Segment #36  [00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:18,000] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 四五百年的時間
Segment #37  [00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,260] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 為什麼能長生不衰
Segment #38  [00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:21,200] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 7  | Text: 因為康家做任何事情
Segment #39  [00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,020] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 7  | Text: 他都會流有餘地
Segment #40  [00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:24,360] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 這叫流有文化
Segment #41  [00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,240] | Elapsed:  47.90s | Words: 3  | Text: 什麼意思呢
Segment #42  [00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,140] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是你不要把這個技巧用性
Segment #43  [00:01:27,140 --> 00:01:29,020] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 要留一些還給造化
Segment #44  [00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,460] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 6  | Text: 那過去很多人都能
Segment #45  [00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:32,460] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 6  | Text: 這個參悟到天道
Segment #46  [00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:33,840] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 但卻不知道怎麼去收臉
Segment #47  [00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,960] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 最終都不太常數
Segment #48  [00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:35,840] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 2  | Text: 你看哈
Segment #49  [00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,660] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 11 | Text: 朱元璋這個烏頭天道之人嘛
Segment #50  [00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:39,660] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 他五十多歲就走了
Segment #51  [00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:41,680] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 11 | Text: 那王陽明六十多歲也就走了
Segment #52  [00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,240] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 10 | Text: 中國翻譯也是六十多歲就走了
Segment #53  [00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:45,680] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 11 | Text: 這就叫不盡之巧以還造化
Segment #54  [00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,740] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 你雖然說參透了天道
Segment #55  [00:01:47,740 --> 00:01:49,380] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 你揣點糊塗不行嘛
Segment #56  [00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:51,000] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 9  | Text: 你把你的本事都用盡了
Segment #57  [00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,080] | Elapsed:  64.56s | Words: 7  | Text: 你還能做很多年嘛
Segment #58  [00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,320] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 後面這個呢就是
Segment #59  [00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,000] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 不盡奉陸以還朝廷
Segment #60  [00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,080] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 你多賺錢了你不妨去
Segment #61  [00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,080] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 3  | Text: 幫忙國家
Segment #62  [00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,440] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 大則保家為國
Segment #63  [00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,200] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 小則興辦意學對不對
Segment #64  [00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,420] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 你看這多好
Segment #65  [00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:06,120] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 曹大王的捐了多少錢呢
Segment #66  [00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,460] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 捐了一兩百個億
Segment #67  [00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:08,900] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 8  | Text: 我記得有一年福建財政
Segment #68  [00:02:09,540 --> 00:02:10,660] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 可能是有困難哈
Segment #69  [00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:11,980] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 9  | Text: 問曹大王借五十個億
Segment #70  [00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:13,340] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 6  | Text: 曹大王說行啊
Segment #71  [00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:15,040] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是你們拿什麼還給我
Segment #72  [00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,060] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 4  | Text: 人家說了
Segment #73  [00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:17,520] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 10 | Text: 說境內有幾個高富公路
Segment #74  [00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,940] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 5  | Text: 收費站這個這個
Segment #75  [00:02:18,940 --> 00:02:20,380] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 7  | Text: 收來的錢你拿著
Segment #76  [00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:20,940] | Elapsed:  81.36s | Words: 3  | Text: 收五年
Segment #77  [00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:22,960] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 11 | Text: 這五年收多少錢你都給你了
Segment #78  [00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,860] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 可是曹大王只收了兩年
Segment #79  [00:02:24,860 --> 00:02:26,120] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 這五十個億就收回來了
Segment #80  [00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,060] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要換正常人
Segment #81  [00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:28,640] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 8  | Text: 那是他三年收的錢
Segment #82  [00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,460] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 不都是利潤嘛
Segment #83  [00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:31,040] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是他不要了
Segment #84  [00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,540] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 8  | Text: 你看人曹大王就說了
Segment #85  [00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:33,480] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 這五十個億
Segment #86  [00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,320] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 我收回來以後
Segment #87  [00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:35,540] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 6  | Text: 後三年我放棄
Segment #88  [00:02:35,540 --> 00:02:37,620] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 9  | Text: 我不占任何朝廷的便宜
Segment #89  [00:02:37,620 --> 00:02:39,140] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 7  | Text: 交給你們全部都給你們
Segment #90  [00:02:39,140 --> 00:02:40,240] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 留了大於地
Segment #91  [00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,920] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 7  | Text: 你看中國有幾個協家
Segment #92  [00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,000] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 6  | Text: 能有這種的胸懷
Segment #93  [00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,000] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 還有這種的智慧
Segment #94  [00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,960] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 7  | Text: 他們不僅各個賺的
Segment #95  [00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,900] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是必須要的
Segment #96  [00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:47,860] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 4  | Text: 必須得這樣
Segment #97  [00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:50,120] | Elapsed:  99.45s | Words: 8  | Text: 都串到自己的跨包裡
Segment #98  [00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,060] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 而且還要去把所有的通常
Segment #99  [00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:52,660] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 得罪一遍
Segment #100 [00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:53,940] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 甚至搶別人的飯碗
Segment #101 [00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:55,440] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 把別人趕緊殺害
Segment #102 [00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,900] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 把別人逼得無路可走
Segment #103 [00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:58,840] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 人不給你平民
Segment #104 [00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:01,940] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 因為你違背了天道
Segment #105 [00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,340] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 天道就有一個特性
Segment #106 [00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:06,120] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 你知道天道的特性是什麼嗎
Segment #107 [00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:10,060] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你有100塊錢
Segment #108 [00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:11,160] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 你要拿出來90塊錢
Segment #109 [00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:12,100] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 稍微惡美託福
Segment #110 [00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,160] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 在道理你懂了
Segment #111 [00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:14,680] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 2  | Text: 懂了
Segment #112 [00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,440] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 那是大師不為什麼不懂
Segment #113 [00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,340] | Elapsed: 114.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 因為他太多了
Segment #114 [00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:21,260] | Elapsed: 122.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 因為太多了手都刷
Segment #115 [00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:22,620] | Elapsed: 122.74s | Words: 3  | Text: 老天們
Segment #116 [00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:24,460] | Elapsed: 122.74s | Words: 8  | Text: 不禁止瞧一環造壞
Segment #117 [00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:26,460] | Elapsed: 122.74s | Words: 8  | Text: 不禁止服一環朝廷
Segment #118 [00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:27,440] | Elapsed: 122.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #119 [00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,440] | Elapsed: 122.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你們越來越好
